p class="mt-1 font-heading text-[18px] font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-mlbb-text sm:text-[22px]"><span class="text-mlbb-gold-bright">+15</span></p></div><div class="relative min-w-0 bg-surface-2/85 px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-3" title="War Axe"><p class="truncate font-heading text-[9.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-mlbb-text-secondary/85">Spell Vamp</p><p class="mt-1 font-heading text-[18px] font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-mlbb-text sm:text-[22px]"><span class="text-mlbb-gold-bright">+8%</span></p></div><div class="relative min-w-0 bg-surface-2/85 px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-3" title="War Axe, Brute Force Breastplate, Oracle, Immortality"><p class="truncate font-heading text-[9.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-mlbb-text-secondary/85">HP</p><p class="mt-1 font-heading text-[18px] font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-mlbb-text sm:text-[22px]"><span class="text-mlbb-gold-bright">+2650</span></p></div></div></div><div class="relative mt-4 overflow-hidden border border-mlbb-gold/18 bg-gradient-to-br from-surface-3/75 to-surface-2/85 px-4 py-3.5"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-mlbb-gold/40 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mb-2.5 flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right-left h-3.5 w-3.5 text-text-accent" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m16 3 4 4-4 4"></path><path d="M20 7H4"></path><path d="m8 21-4-4 4-4"></path><path d="M4 17h16"></path></svg><p class="font-heading text-[10.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-text-accent">Situational Swaps</p></div><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-mlbb-text-secondary"><a class="font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/warrior-boots">Warrior Boots</a><span class="inline-flex items-baseline gap-1.5 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text-secondary/80"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right relative top-[1px] h-3 w-3 text-text-accent/65" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><span class="text-mlbb-text-secondary/65">over</span><a class="font-semibold text-text-accent transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/tough-boots">Tough Boots</a></span><span class="basis-full text-[12.5px] text-mlbb-text-secondary/90 sm:basis-auto sm:before:mx-1 sm:before:text-mlbb-text-secondary/50 sm:before:content-[&#x27;•&#x27;]">Use when jungle duels are mostly physical and the enemy lacks reliable slows or chain control.</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-mlbb-text-secondary"><a class="font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/flame-retribution">Flame Retribution</a><span class="inline-flex items-baseline gap-1.5 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text-secondary/80"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right relative top-[1px] h-3 w-3 text-text-accent/65" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><span class="text-mlbb-text-secondary/65">over</span><a class="font-semibold text-text-accent transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/ice-retribution">Ice Retribution</a></span><span class="basis-full text-[12.5px] text-mlbb-text-secondary/90 sm:basis-auto sm:before:mx-1 sm:before:text-mlbb-text-secondary/50 sm:before:content-[&#x27;•&#x27;]">Use as the jungle blessing when your team already has enough slows and X.Borg needs more finishing damage on low targets.</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-mlbb-text-secondary"><a class="font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/cursed-helmet">Cursed Helmet</a><span class="inline-flex items-baseline gap-1.5 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text-secondary/80"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right relative top-[1px] h-3 w-3 text-text-accent/65" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><span class="text-mlbb-text-secondary/65">over</span><a class="font-semibold text-text-accent transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/hunter-strike">Hunter Strike</a></span><span class="basis-full text-[12.5px] text-mlbb-text-secondary/90 sm:basis-auto sm:before:mx-1 sm:before:text-mlbb-text-secondary/50 sm:before:content-[&#x27;•&#x27;]">Use when clear speed and high-HP frontline presence matter more than chase speed from Hunter Strike.</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-mlbb-text-secondary"><a class="font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/dominance-ice">Dominance Ice</a><span class="inline-flex items-baseline gap-1.5 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text-secondary/80"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width=