ueen's Wings\",\"text\":\"Purchase Queen's Wings (2,250 gold) as item 4 in the EXP Vengeance Frontline build for X.Borg.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/x-borg#build-exp-vengeance-frontline\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Antique Cuirass\",\"text\":\"Purchase Antique Cuirass (2,170 gold) as item 5 in the EXP Vengeance Frontline build for X.Borg.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/x-borg#build-exp-vengeance-frontline\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the EXP Vengeance Frontline build for X.Borg.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/x-borg#build-exp-vengeance-frontline\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/x-borg\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5e:[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$63\"}}]\n64:T901,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to Build X.Borg in Mobile Legends: Jungle Tempo Burn\",\"description\":\"Jungle setup for tempo drafts that want X.Borg to clear safely, enter Turtle fights with War Axe uptime, and use Ice Retribution to keep targets in Fire Missiles.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"War Axe\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Brute Force Breastplate\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Hunter Strike\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Fighter Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Retribution Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Tough Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Tough Boots (700 gold) as item 1 in the Jungle Tempo Burn build for X.Borg.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/x-borg#build-jungle-tempo-burn\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy War Axe\",\"text\":\"Purchase War Axe (2,100 gold) as item 2 in the Jungle Tempo Burn build for X.Borg.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/x-borg#build-jungle-tempo-burn\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Brute Force Breastplate\",\"text\":\"Purchase Brute Force Breastplate (1,870 gold) as item 3 in the Jungle Tempo Burn build for X.Borg.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/x-borg#build-jungle-tempo-burn\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Hunter Strike\",\"text\":\"Purchase Hunter Strike (2,010 gold) as item 4 in the Jungle Tempo Burn build for X.Borg.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/x-borg#build-jungle-tempo-burn\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Oracle\",\"text\":\"Purchase Oracle (1,860 gold) as item 5 in the Jungle Tempo Burn build for X.Borg.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/x-borg#build-jungle-tempo-burn\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the Jungle Tempo Burn build for X.Borg.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/x-borg#build-jungle-tempo-burn\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/x-borg\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":83,\"name\":\"X.Borg\",\"slug\":\"x-borg\",\"title\":\"Firaga Armor\",\"role\":[\"Fighter\"],\"specialty\":[\"Regen\",\"Burst\"],\"lane\":[\"EXP\"],\"tier\":\"B\",\"difficulty\":2,\"releaseYear\":2019,\"stats\":{\"durability\":80,\"offense\":30,\"controlEffect\":10,\"difficulty\":60},\"winRate\":49.9,\"pickRate\":0.59,\"banRate\":1.78,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"terizla\",\"heroName\":\"Terizla\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"X.Borg counters Fighters that lack mobility, such as Terizla and Aulus. His 1st Skill has a large range and can be cast while moving, making it easy for him to kite.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"aulus\",\"heroName\":\"Aulus\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"X.Borg counters Fighters that lack mobility, such as Terizla and Aulus. His 1st Skill has a large range and can be cast while moving, making it easy for him to kite.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"martis\",\"heroName\":\"Martis\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"X.Borg is countered by Fighters with burst damage like Martis and Dyrroth. They can quickly burst down X.Borg when he is Armorless.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"dyrroth\",\"heroName\":\"Dyrroth\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"X.Borg is countered by Fighters with burst damage like Martis and Dyrroth. They can quickly burst down X.Borg when he is Armorless.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/gms/image/52e2334206e3b30354b129f86ada1ef5.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_efe9c7ed8d8f84f1bb0f88a3e08de5fc.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"54\",\"heroName\":\"Jawhead\",\"heroSlug\":\"jawhead\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_9bddad128d45821b7fd6abb9773d7c53.png\",\"tip\":\"Jawhead, Angela, Johnson\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"49\",\"heroName\":\"Hylos\",\"heroSlug\":\"hylos\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_f3ddb1088279d711417234034024223d.png\",\"tip\":\"Hylos, Argus, Dyrroth\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"74\",\"heroName\":\"Minsitthar\",\"heroSlug\":\"minsitthar\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/4ca3844586ef2cce730279ba44b6313b.png?w=150-150-31231d\",\"tip\":\"Minsitthar, Diggie, Zhask\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Firaga Armor\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Firaga Armor inherits 160% of X.Borg's Max HP and absorbs all incoming damage when it's active. When destroyed, X.Borg rolls in the direction of the Joystick (he is invincible during this process). The Armor's energy will gradually regenerate while X.Borg is in the Armorless State. At full energy, X.Borg re-equips the Armor and restores it to 30% HP.\\nX.Borg's attacks cause enemies to enter the Overheated state. Enemies in the Overheated state will drop Firaga Supplies when they take damage from X.Borg. Picking up supplies restores 10% of the Armor's HP (or 10 Energy while in the Armorless State).\\nX.Borg's skills deal True Damage to enemies in the Overheated state.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Firaga Armor inherits 160% of X.Borg's Max HP and absorbs all incoming damage when it's active. When destroyed, X.Borg rolls in the direction of the Joystick (he is invincible during this process). The Armor's energy will gradually regenerate while X.Borg is in the Armorless State. At full energy, X.Borg re-equips the Armor and restores it to 30% HP.\\nX.Borg's attacks cause enemies to enter the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Overheated\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" state. Enemies in the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Overheated\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" state will drop Firaga Supplies when they take damage from X.Borg. Picking up supplies restores 10% of the Armor's HP (or 10 Energy while in the Armorless State).\\nX.Borg's skills deal True Damage to enemies in the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Overheated\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" state.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_89f511f46d1e6c6db972cf7bb37924f5.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Fire Missiles\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"X.Borg sprays fire, dealing 25 (+60% Total Physical Attack) (+40% Total Magic Power) Physical Damage 7 times over 2s to enemies in front of him (75% damage to minions).\\n\\nArmorless State: The attack area becomes narrower but longer, while the damage is reduced to 60%.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"X.Borg sprays fire, dealing 25\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+60% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"(+40% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" 7 times over 2s to enemies in front of him (75% damage to minions). \\n\\nArmorless State: The attack area becomes narrower but longer, while the damage is reduced to 60%.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"4s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4ee1680e53d5823b14f9989bc10bc719.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\"]},{\"name\":\"Fire Stake\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"X.Borg fires 5 Fire Stakes forward and recalls them after 1.7s. Each stake deals 50 (+20% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and pulls enemies and Firaga Supplies along its path back to him.\\n\\nArmorless State: X.Borg adjusts the Fire Stake launcher, making the stakes travel farther and closer together.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"X.Borg fires 5 Fire Stakes forward and recalls them after 1.7s. Each stake deals 50\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+20% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and pulls enemies and Firaga Supplies along its path back to him.\\n\\nArmorless State: X.Borg adjusts the Fire Stake launcher, making the stakes travel farther and closer together.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"9s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9194fa592d8f77a7b9e9b1676e47b3e4.png\",\"tags\":[\"CC\"]},{\"name\":\"Last Insanity\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"X.Borg charges in the target direction while spinning and spraying fire (cannot pick up Firaga Supplies during this time), dealing 90 (+60% Extra Physical Attack) (+45% Total Magic Power) Physical Damage 12 times and slowing enemies hit by 25%. He stops upon touching an enemy hero and will slow them by an additional 40%.\\nAfter 3s, his mecha suit detonates, dealing 300 (+ 15% target's Max HP) True Damage. If his armor is destroyed, it will immediately explode, but damage drops to 50%. The detonation destroys his armor, removes all control effects, and collects all nearby Firaga Supplies. Cannot be used in Armorless State.\\n\\nUse Again: Immediately stop spraying fire and detonate early.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"X.Borg charges in the target direction while spinning and spraying fire (cannot pick up Firaga Supplies during this time), dealing 90\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+60% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"(+45% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" 12 times and slowing enemies hit by 25%. He stops upon touching an enemy hero and will slow them by an additional 40%.\\nAfter 3s, his mecha suit detonates, dealing 300 (+ 15% target's Max HP) True Damage. If his armor is destroyed, it will immediately explode, but damage drops to 50%. The detonation destroys his armor, removes all control effects, and collects all nearby Firaga Supplies. Cannot be used in \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Armorless State\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\\n\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Use Again\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": Immediately stop spraying fire and detonate early.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"30s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_fece4e752139100505f5eb2bd08390aa.png\",\"tags\":[\"Burst\",\"Mobility\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-1-2\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"Prioritize Fire Missiles and Ultimate\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Prioritize Fire Missiles and Ultimate\"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"karina\",\"heroName\":\"Karina\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"X.Borg pairs well with heroes who excel in burst damage, such as Karina and Martis. X.Borg's AOE damage will leave enemies low enough for his teammate to finishing off.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"martis\",\"heroName\":\"Martis\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"X.Borg pairs well with heroes who excel in burst damage, such as Karina and Martis. X.Borg's AOE damage will leave enemies low enough for his teammate to finishing off.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, cast X.Borg's 1st Skill, then activate his Ultimate when enemies are clustered, and uses his 2nd Skill to pull them back to him.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":8310,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4ee1680e53d5823b14f9989bc10bc719.png\"},{\"skillId\":8330,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_fece4e752139100505f5eb2bd08390aa.png\"},{\"skillId\":8320,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9194fa592d8f77a7b9e9b1676e47b3e4.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, cast X.Borg's 1st Skill then use his 2nd Skill to pull enemies toward him.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":8310,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4ee1680e53d5823b14f9989bc10bc719.png\"},{\"skillId\":8320,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9194fa592d8f77a7b9e9b1676e47b3e4.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"X.Borg build, counter, and emblem guide for Mobile Legends. Learn his War Axe spike, EXP lane draft rules, flex items, and Firaga Armor timing in MLBB.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"X.Borg is an EXP laner who wins by making one trade last longer than the enemy planned for. He is not a blind comfort pick into every fighter lane. He is a frontliner with a fake second life, and the draft only feels easy when the enemy cannot break Firaga Armor before your fire turns the lane into dead space.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"x-borg\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-13\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"exp-war-axe-control\",\"name\":\"EXP War Axe Control\",\"roleContext\":\"EXP\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\",\"cost\":2100,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"brute-force-breastplate\",\"name\":\"Brute Force Breastplate\",\"cost\":1870,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\",\"cost\":1860,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\",\"cost\":2010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\"},{\"slug\":\"brute-force-breastplate\",\"name\":\"Brute Force Breastplate\"},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"fighter\",\"name\":\"Fighter Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"firmness\",\"name\":\"Firmness\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/firmness.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"festival-of-blood\",\"name\":\"Festival of Blood\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/festival-of-blood.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"brave-smite\",\"name\":\"Brave Smite\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/brave-smite.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"flicker\",\"name\":\"Flicker\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"warrior-boots\",\"name\":\"Warrior Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use into physical EXP lanes when slows and crowd control are not the main reason X.Borg loses armor.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"ice-queen-wand\",\"name\":\"Ice Queen Wand\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when your team lacks slows and X.Borg needs every Fire Missiles tag to keep short-range enemies inside the burn.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"antique-cuirass\",\"name\":\"Antique Cuirass\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when repeated physical skill damage breaks Firaga Armor before X.Borg can collect supplies.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against one-shot magic burst that can erase the real body after Firaga Armor drops.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default EXP setup for long front-to-back fights where X.Borg stacks War Axe and Brute Force before converting repeated fire into objective control.\",\"totalCost\":10660,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"physatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":35,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\"]},{\"key\":\"spellvamp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.spellVamp\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":8,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":2650,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Brute Force Breastplate\",\"Oracle\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":95,\"sources\":[\"Brute Force Breastplate\",\"Oracle\",\"Dominance Ice\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"magicdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":78,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\",\"Oracle\",\"Dominance Ice\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeedPct\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":5,\"sources\":[\"Dominance Ice\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":30,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Brute Force Breastplate\",\"Oracle\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=x-borg\u0026items=tough-boots%2Cwar-axe%2Cbrute-force-breastplate%2Coracle%2Cdominance-ice%2Cimmortality\u0026spell=flicker\u0026emblem=fighter\u0026talents=firmness%2Cfestival-of-blood%2Cbrave-smite\u0026flex=warrior-boots.tough-boots%2Cice-queen-wand.dominance-ice%2Cantique-cuirass.dominance-ice%2Cathenas-shield.dominance-ice\"},{\"slot\":2,\"id\":\"exp-vengeance-frontline\",\"name\":\"EXP Vengeance Frontline\",\"roleContext\":\"EXP\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"warrior-boots\",\"name\":\"Warrior Boots\",\"cost\":720,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\",\"cost\":2100,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"brute-force-breastplate\",\"name\":\"Brute Force Breastplate\",\"cost\":1870,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"queens-wings\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\",\"cost\":2250,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"antique-cuirass\",\"name\":\"Antique Cuirass\",\"cost\":2170,\"fixed\":false},{\"s